  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Add PDStatusRollUp lazy-loading support via optional OnBeforeExpand callback: fires before each node is expanded, receives the target node, returns an updated node or null to leave unchanged. Backwards compatible - existing static trees are unaffected.\n      - Add PDStatusRollUpNode.Expandable (bool?) tri-state: true forces drillable chevron (for nodes whose children arrive lazily), false forces non-drillable, null (default) auto-detects from Children.\n      - Add PDStatusRollUp.TriggerIconSize parameter (string?) for custom icon sizing (e.g. \"1rem\", \"16px\"); defaults to .85rem baseline via CSS for backwards compatibility.\n      - Add PDStatusRollUp.TriggerTitle parameter (string, default \"Click to view status\") for customisable hover tooltip on the trigger.\n      - Add onmousedown/onmouseup stopPropagation to PDStatusRollUp trigger to prevent accidental row selection in parent PDTable components.\n      - Add user-select: none to PDStatusRollUp popup header and item rows so text cannot be accidentally selected.\n      - Replace hardcoded PDStatusRollUp icon colours with Bootstrap text utilities (text-danger, text-success, text-secondary); amber kept as --pdsr-color-amber CSS variable (default #fd7e14, overridable).\n      - Fix PDStatusRollUp trigger icon not updating after lazy root expansion.\n      - Fix PDStatusRollUp spinner positioning on deeper drill levels.\n      - Fix PDStatusRollUp parent row icon not reflecting resolved status after drill-down.\n      - Fix GenerateDocs.ps1 to handle inline [Parameter] attributes and generic type signatures.",
